  "hints": [
    "Two visitors clicking the same slot is a classic race. What makes booking it atomic?",
    "Availability pages are viewed far more than slots are booked: cache them.",
    "LB (2) → API (3) with Redis locks (2); API → Redis (2) → Postgres (3 replicas), and API → Postgres for bookings."
